WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.976
LETITIA WRIGHT
Hey everyone.

00:00:01.027 --> 00:00:03.445
DANAI GURIRA
We're the cast of Marvel Studios'...

00:00:05.531 --> 00:00:07.282
DOMINIQUE THORNE
And today we'll find out which one of us...

00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:09.234
TENOCH HUERTA MEJÍA
...knows our castmates the best.

00:00:09.285 --> 00:00:10.341
LUPITA NYONG'O
And guess who's going to win?

00:00:10.391 --> 00:00:11.352
LETITIA WRIGHT
I am.

00:00:11.403 --> 00:00:11.812
LUPITA NYONG'O
Please.

00:00:11.863 --> 00:00:13.572
ANGELA BASSETT
Let the guessing begin.

00:00:16.372 --> 00:00:17.326
LUPITA NYONG'O
This person has an...

00:00:21.174 --> 00:00:22.039
I know this answer.

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:22.580
WINSTON DUKE
You go.

00:00:22.631 --> 00:00:22.956
DANAI GURIRA
You go.

00:00:23.151 --> 00:00:23.843
ANGELA BASSETT
Dominique?

00:00:23.894 --> 00:00:26.927
WINSTON DUKE
I'm going to go with Angela Bassett.

00:00:26.978 --> 00:00:27.803
TENOCH HUERTA MEJÍA
Uh, Winston.

00:00:27.854 --> 00:00:28.387
DANAI GURIRA
Letitia Wright.

00:00:28.438 --> 00:00:29.588
LUPITA NYONG'O
It's Dominique.

00:00:30.588 --> 00:00:32.616
LETITIA WRIGHT
'Cause she kept talking about it on set.

00:00:32.666 --> 00:00:33.035
[Laughing]

00:00:33.085 --> 00:00:34.296
RIRI WILLIAMS
To be young, gifted, and Black,

00:00:34.346 --> 00:00:34.897
though, right?

00:00:34.948 --> 00:00:35.836
LETITIA WRIGHT
This person has...

00:00:38.891 --> 00:00:40.424
- Wow.
- Wow.

00:00:40.475 --> 00:00:41.309
DANAI GURIRA
Tenoch.

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:42.801
LUPITA NYONG'O
It's definitely Angela Bassett.

00:00:42.851 --> 00:00:43.727
WINSTON DUKE
Angela Bassett.

00:00:43.778 --> 00:00:45.137
ANGELA BASSETT
I think that might be me.

00:00:45.188 --> 00:00:47.589
DOMINIQUE THORNE
This has got to be Miss Angela Bassett.

00:00:47.639 --> 00:00:49.508
LETITIA WRIGHT
I'm gonna say it's Tenoch.

00:00:49.607 --> 00:00:50.092
LUPITA NYONG'O
Whoa!

00:00:50.142 --> 00:00:51.352
TENOCH HUERTA MEJÍA
Angela Bassett.

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:52.396
Oh!

00:00:52.446 --> 00:00:54.330
LETITIA WRIGHT
[Screaming]

00:00:54.381 --> 00:00:55.956
LUPITA NYONG'O
You got me, man!

00:00:56.007 --> 00:00:58.859
WINSTON DUKE
Oooh, that was good, you pulled away!

00:00:58.909 --> 00:00:59.661
This person is...

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.404
DANAI GURIRA
What?

00:01:02.908 --> 00:01:03.611
DOMINIQUE THORNE
Lupita!

00:01:03.662 --> 00:01:04.915
DANAI GURIRA
What sort of doctor?

00:01:04.966 --> 00:01:06.250
WINSTON DUKE
Has to be a PhD.

00:01:06.603 --> 00:01:07.125
TENOCH HUERTA MEJÍA
Danai.

00:01:07.176 --> 00:01:08.360
LETITIA WRIGHT
Miss Angela Bassett.

00:01:08.411 --> 00:01:09.528
DANAI GURIRA
It might be me.

00:01:10.941 --> 00:01:12.372
ANGELA BASSETT
Oh!

00:01:12.422 --> 00:01:14.328
I am a doctor,
I have 5 doctorates.

00:01:14.378 --> 00:01:15.175
LUPITA NYONG'O
It's true, though.

00:01:15.226 --> 00:01:15.769
LETITIA WRIGHT
Right?

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:17.035
DANAI GURIRA
Don't hate the player!

00:01:17.085 --> 00:01:18.375
M'BAKU
You bald headed demon.

00:01:18.425 --> 00:01:20.552
RAMONDA
Show some respect, you two.

00:01:20.603 --> 00:01:21.264
LUPITA NYONG'O
This person...

00:01:24.966 --> 00:01:26.228
Well, it's not you, that's good.

00:01:26.279 --> 00:01:27.046
TENOCH HUERTA MEJÍA
Uh, Winston.

00:01:27.096 --> 00:01:28.347
ANGELA BASSETT
I'll say Letitia.

00:01:28.397 --> 00:01:29.406
DOMINIQUE THORNE
Tenoch.

00:01:29.457 --> 00:01:30.082
LUPITA NYONG'O
Can I guess?

00:01:30.133 --> 00:01:30.860
LETITIA WRIGHT
Yeah.

00:01:30.911 --> 00:01:32.609
LUPITA NYONG'O
I think it's Michaela Coel.

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:33.560
WINSTON DUKE
Letitia Wright.

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:35.412
DANAI GURIRA
I'm going to agree.

00:01:35.463 --> 00:01:36.079
LETITIA WRIGHT
Who is it?

00:01:36.336 --> 00:01:37.106
Thank you.

00:01:37.335 --> 00:01:37.956
WINSTON DUKE
Woo!

00:01:38.007 --> 00:01:41.937
LUPITA NYONG'O
[Gasp] Your poker face was amazing!

00:01:41.987 --> 00:01:43.115
DANAI GURIRA
Come learn more about the

00:01:43.165 --> 00:01:45.072
next chapter
of our characters...

00:01:45.122 --> 00:01:47.074
ANGELA BASSETT
...in Black Panther: Wakanda Forever.

00:01:47.125 --> 00:01:48.325
DOMINIQUE THORNE
Only in theaters...

00:01:48.376 --> 00:01:50.027
DANAI/WINSTON
...November 11th.

